Reserved: vendored Adobe CMap resources
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This file reserves the attribution for character-map data to be vendored under
vendor/cmaps/ at milestone M3 (see docs/05-MILESTONES.md).

That data — the Adobe CMap resources and associated glyph-name tables — is
distributed by Adobe Systems Incorporated under the BSD 3-Clause License. Its
full licence text and copyright notice will be reproduced in vendor/cmaps/
alongside the data itself when it lands.

The data is vendored rather than fetched: it does not churn, regenerating it is
pure cost, and a build that reaches the network to obtain it is a build whose
output depends on the network (docs/04-ARCHITECTURE.md §5).

No CMap data is present in this repository yet.
